Since the method uses `AddKeyedSingleton`, which is an extension method, I will assume it registers a singleton service. I will set up the service provider to return a mock `ILoggerFactory` when `GetService<ILoggerFactory>()` is called. Then, I will verify that the service collection registration correctly invokes the `GetService` method and that the registration produces a service that can be resolved.

